1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,627
A four mark comparison.

2
00:00:01,627 --> 00:00:14,166
Non-cyclic uses both photosystems, has an open path from water to NADP plus, splits water, and makes ATP, NADPH and oxygen, mainly in the grana.

3
00:00:14,166 --> 00:00:24,114
Cyclic uses photosystem one alone, in a closed loop, splits no water and makes only ATP, mainly in the stroma lamellae.

